<title>USA: El Salvador seeks U.S. soymeal and edible tallow.</title>
<headline>El Salvador seeks U.S. soymeal and edible tallow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador is seeking about 7,565 to 8,360 tonnes of U.S. high-protein soybean meal under PL 480, Title I, slated for November 1-15 delivery, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>It is also tendering for about 3,900 to 4,330 tonnes of edible tallow in bulk under PL 480, Title I, for September 26-October 10 and/or October 1-15 delivery periods.</p>
<p>Offers are due for both commodities by September 16 and are valid until September 17.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
